# Production values, once the real database password is pasted in.
.env.production
# A tracked symlink (not a secret file itself) to the repo-root .env, so
# Prisma's CLI — which only auto-loads a .env from its own package dir —
# picks up DATABASE_URL without every dev needing to `source` it manually.
!packages/db/.env
